Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 15:04:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Lakeside r4 (reviewer): landing END pose = board camera
 (360x780 reference), hook closes only the per-screen residual

- RegionJourneyCore: Landing key arrivalFovDeg (FOV eases fovDeg -> value with the arrival weight; 0 = unchanged for other
  routes); arrivalYawToHer removed again
- LakesideCameraLayout: landing 6.8 m back / 1.1 m right / 3.0 m up, aim = board aim (pitch -2.80422 vs focus), FOV 55.2171;
  portrait board position = landing position exactly (no rounding); lakesideLandingBlend gains gap{positionM,viewDeg,fovDeg}
  and done(t) (swap frame); docs: preload the board scene before the blend, swap on done()
- test: K8 asserts no gap at 360x780 (<= 1e-6 m / 0.01 deg / 0.01 deg FOV), reports residual per portrait layout, done()/at()
  swap frame; robust angle (atan2) and float tolerances in the monotonic / single-peak checks
